  identifies the Gens codebase as GPLv2. That statement does not override
  individual third-party notices or establish the terms of every file.
- Modifications to upstream components remain subject to the applicable
  upstream terms. Retain the original notices and provide corresponding
  source and build instructions when required.
- There is no distributed core artifact yet. The terms of a combined
  artifact have not been established. In particular, the Starscream notices
